Comment:
 This tree is a fork of HesiPullupTimbo/msi-psu-monitor v1.0.0: device discovery,
 the HID transport and the original sensor parsing originate there. The
 variant-aware 0xE0 parsing, the E1h alert engine and software per-pin mirror,
 the C1h black-box reader, the 0xC0/0xC1 OCP views, the resident daemon, the
 dashboard, the Debian packaging and the test suite were added on top.
 No vendor code was copied; the protocol was verified against the CWT REV6 USB
 command specification and against MSI Center's observed read behaviour.
